# Avatar Aang: "Whenever you waterbend, earthbend, firebend, or airbend, draw a card. Then if you've done all four this turn,
# transform Avatar Aang." Aang is cast on turn 1; on turn 7 Bot1 earthbends (Badgermole Cub, CR 701.66b), airbends (Airbending
# Lesson on Bot2's Grizzly Bears, CR 701.65b), waterbends (Flexible Waterbender's {3}, paid by tapping three Moxen, CR 701.67c) and
# then attacks with Aang, whose firebending 2 resolves (CR 702.189b). Each of the first three bends draws a card and leaves Aang as
# he is; the fourth draws too and transforms him, so he deals 6 combat damage as Aang, Master of Elements rather than 4.

